From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:39:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] loader: Build the preloader without LTO.

The preloader is linked static at a fixed high address; compiled to
LTO bitcode (CFLAGS=-flto=thin, MacNeutron's performance build), its
code was generated at link time for the default small code model and
lld refused its R_X86_64_32 relocations. It runs once per process,
before exec: nothing to gain from LTO.

Assisted-by: Claude Code: claude-opus-5-5
---
 loader/Makefile.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/loader/Makefile.in b/loader/Makefile.in
index a9ca82f3..af74a571 100644
--- a/loader/Makefile.in
+++ b/loader/Makefile.in
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ PROGRAMS = $(WINELOADER_PROGRAMS)
 INSTALL_LIB = $(WINELOADER_PROGRAMS)
 UNIX_CFLAGS = -fPIE
 
-preloader_EXTRADEFS = -fno-builtin
+preloader_EXTRADEFS = -fno-builtin -fno-lto
 
 wine_OBJS = main.o
 wine_DEPS = $(WINELOADER_DEPENDS)
